## Original Content
<p>Today, Google is expanding its AI Professional Certificate on Coursera with their newest course on vibe coding that helps learners move from AI users to AI builders.&#160; For decades, building software required learning to code. But now, with vibe coding, AI is making it possible for professionals across industries to build applications that automate everyday [&#8230;]</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://blog.coursera.org/google-helps-professionals-with-new-vibe-coding-course/">Google helps professionals become AI creators with new vibe coding course on Coursera</a> appeared first on <a href="https://blog.coursera.org">Coursera Blog</a>.</p>

## Summary
Google has expanded its AI Professional Certificate on Coursera with a new course focused on vibe coding. This course enables professionals to transition from using AI to building AI applications without traditional coding skills. It represents a shift in software development by leveraging AI for easier application creation.

## Key Points
- Google launched a new vibe coding course as part of its AI Professional Certificate on Coursera.
- Vibe coding allows professionals to build AI applications with minimal coding knowledge.
- The course aims to democratize AI development by making it accessible to non-experts.
- This initiative reflects a growing trend in AI-assisted software creation.


